  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user describes a deep puncture wound from a rusty trowel and asks for guidance on whether to see a doctor or treat it at home. The assistant provides cautious advice, suggesting the user may need medical attention and recommending soap and water over peroxide or alcohol for wound cleaning.",
    "scores": {
